Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.52,0:00:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanctuary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.30,0:00:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddammit, I ain't got all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I thought, there's not a trace\Nof mold on you, even though you fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Cioccolata green tea was supposed\Nto ravage any living thing in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So how the hell are\Nyou still in one piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.58,0:00:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll just have to do\Nit the old-fashioned way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Beating you over and over again\Nuntil your body stops moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my sanctuary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't be a quick kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to put some\Ndistance between us fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.04,0:00:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.94,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cameo, no sa tame ni sa e?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, hear Cairo, su.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.78,0:01:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,GameStop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.20,0:02:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That malicious mole should\Nbe far behind by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.38,0:03:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all these accidents?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,An ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.05,0:03:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Down by the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did all the mold go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.24,0:03:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocohata!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's getting eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That means they did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Ragazzi. Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Squalo, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.86,0:03:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you disposed of Buchorati?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I've run into a few\Ncomplications on my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.54,0:03:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I get around to killing Giorno,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.70,0:03:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've taken a bit of a\Nhindering blow to the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So to err on the side of caution,\NI must share something with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely, Seko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Those bastards are\Nheaded for the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bone Boys babbling bullets said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.82,0:03:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They're supposed to meet someone there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone who boasts of having secret\Nknowledge on how to fake with the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It should baffle no one\Nthen that Giorno and his
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,friends would be so eager to\Nmake it to this rendezvous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you getting any of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You must uncover this\Nsecret before anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.14,0:04:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All that drama over a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, what did he learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.08,0:04:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Cioccolata!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought I'd get all weepy over you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break, loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost to clowns!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you supposed to\Nbe some kind of genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,With perfect throwing arms full of yummy\Nsugar cubes and a crazy fat load of cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, you're super strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I thought you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only reason why I've been\Nbothering to listen to you this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But it turns out you're\Njust another weakling!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You totally ate shit out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well guess what I don't want to hang\Nout with you anymore, so kiss my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the he's heading\Nstraight toward the Coliseum
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,someone's clued him into our\Ngoal after the secret, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I think not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the other?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.98,0:05:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Zippermen, go for the kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.62,0:05:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.53,0:05:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you think it's funny\Nhow the word coliseum
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,sounds a hell of a lot\Nlike the word mausoleum?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Language Expert?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you wouldn't mind if I sent\Nyou there instead, now would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.26,0:05:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Merda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wrong to assume the only\Ndanger was the man in the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still miles away from\Nbeing out of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This tunneling fiend is a\Ncolossal threat all on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If he should slip from my grasp\Nand get to the Colosseum first,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have unleashed a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.48,0:06:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an awful pest, you\Nknow that, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why bother fighting back at this point?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,At such a close range, I can\Noutrun and outmuscle you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll swat you like a fly, little twerp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a pretty quick\Nthinker now, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.80,0:06:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your big brain saved you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just barely, though, so don't get cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, that body of yours is really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're riddled with glass, and\Nyet there's not a drop of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see what I just saw, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.44,0:07:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It was somewhere on the\Nsecond level, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.84,0:07:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The blinky, shiny thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.22,0:07:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened earlier, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There was something crawling in\Nthe shadows just now. Must be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It was quick, but I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a reflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt from a peeping\Npair of binoculars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the fellow you and your stupid\Nfriends have been so desperate to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.78,0:07:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I saw him in a wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One of his legs looked like a prosthetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem like\Na guy who could fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that secret's as good as mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can suck him, you\Nbloodless sack of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.02,0:07:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck on these knuckles specifically!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.34,0:07:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So now you're making fun of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.36,0:08:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your stupid zippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat shit, copycat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if you've forgotten, but\Nyou're swimming around in my territory now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna rip your dumbass\Napart! Take this! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's not hiding down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.66,0:08:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to move about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.44,0:08:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting some crazy vibrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.40,0:08:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just where are you off to in\Nsuch a hurry, you damn coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Running away with my trick? Boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you got a whole lot of nerve trying to\Nmimic me like I'm some kind of idiotic joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you think you're hot shit\Nwith your zipper stand right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All you really did was\Nsteal my moves, little rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That lack of creativity is about to bite\Nyou because I am a million times better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.84,0:08:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,at this than your dumbass will ever be you\Nwon't send one foot in the Coliseum. The
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,walls
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,are turning
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.81,0:09:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,rubbery again so
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,he's already on my trail but this noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question it's rushing straight\Ntoward me with an incredible speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound may be able to travel\Nfastest through solids,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.06,0:09:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but this liquid-like material\Nwon't offer me much protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.72,0:09:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That probably means he's been able to\Nhear my every move this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually got quite far for\Na complete rookie, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.62,0:09:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A pathetic 20 meters ahead\Nand slightly to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Turning right, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten more meters to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now just seven meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.72,0:09:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Five meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Strangling you now would be too lenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.62,0:09:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you know you've just buried\Nyourself alive, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.14,0:09:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you gonna dodge when\Nyou're surrounded by dirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be no different from punching\Na helplessly tied-up little worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just two more meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.74,0:10:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A water pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to shake\Nme with that? Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.66,0:10:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You out of smart ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, these pathetic little stunts of\Nyours freaking reek of utter desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even have to say a single word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.86,0:10:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging from your actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.14,0:10:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can already tell\Nyou've come to terms with
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,meeting your end at the\Nhands of my sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.26,0:10:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure exactly where,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.60,0:10:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can sense your carcass\Nlanguishing just 20 meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.26,0:10:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying still in the hopes\Nthat I won't find you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.00,0:10:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like a little bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you up to something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You got another plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a quick thinker after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All the brains in the world\Ncan't save you from me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for you to die, Smarty Pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.36,0:11:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That sound just now is new.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got me surrounded. Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even all those big rocks in the ground...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.80,0:11:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,turn right into mud when they're\Nexposed to my Sanctuary's touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But the moment my body\Nstarts moving away from them,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,they harden right back into stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a little tip for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.20,0:11:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen well and you'll definitely\Nmake it out of this alive, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.02,0:11:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing you gotta do to live is\Nremain as still as you possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.56,0:12:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess it'd take a real\Nmiracle for you to pull that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you must have heard of the\Nguy who was hanged three times,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but lived because the rope kept\Nbreaking every time they dropped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Zero, I can't stay\Ndown here much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But resurfacing now\Nisn't an option either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I prepared myself for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But should they fail to make it, I'll\Nhave no choice but to destroy the Arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.80,0:12:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All hope hinges on them\Ncrossing paths with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If, in his true heart of hearts, a\Nhero wishes to defeat Emperor Crimson,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,he will have no choice but to\Nlearn of the Arrow's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.98,0:12:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate has decided that hero\Nshall not be me, but them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Twelve years ago, it entered my\Npossession after the battle in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.48,0:12:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The horrors this artifact has wrought will
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:13:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,continue to rage on until they stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all rather ironic,\None might venture to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Deemed pariahs and cast from society,\Nthey sought family in the Mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet here they are, determined to save the\Nsame world from which they were shunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.84,0:13:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do little more than\Nhope that you, Bucciarati,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,will be able to make it here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.90,0:13:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All will be rendered pointless\Nif you fail to triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When that happens, the arrow and\Nits secret must fade into oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So I patiently await\Nyou, Harbinger of Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing I'm able to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll begin once you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, I'll continue\Nto preserve its true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.94,0:13:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I have been for all those\Ninterminable and torturous years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use. I gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He finally gave in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you I hear squirming\Naround 12 meters to the right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you can't be thinking about\Ntaking shelter under the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.38,0:14:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the dumbest idea you've had today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.90,0:14:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I let you do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming in hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.26,0:14:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear him frantically\Nworking his way closer and closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.46,0:14:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a noisy target!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can easily tell he's just ten meters\Nin front of me now eight meters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.34,0:14:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't possibly hope to outrun him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.26,0:14:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.82,0:14:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:14:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.74,0:15:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This was a damn cool scheme for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Bucciarati,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,is this really how the great mafioso\Nflails when he's been backed into a corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,big congrats to you on being the first\Nperson to successfully hide from Sanctuary,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.78,0:15:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,even if it was just for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But playtime's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.30,0:15:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hide forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you're welcome\Nto try if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.44,0:15:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll just make killing\Nyou that much sweeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My skin, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.58,0:15:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the stone pavement\Nis melting into mud!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.70,0:15:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And so will your body\Nonce I finally get to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The closer I get, the Capri you'll become!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that just swell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you! You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You really made me work for\Nit, but I've got you at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All that remains between us\Nis one and a half meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how close you got to\Nmaking it to the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh darn it, you almost got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That tantalizing secret is all mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Zipperman, showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people might call it a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.32,0:16:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I'm baffled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.16,0:16:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I could shatter any bone in my body\Nwithout feeling an ounce of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart doesn't beat, so\NI don't bleed much either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing truly hurts me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that, I laid a trap for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.64,0:16:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's hoping my eardrums are\Nas resilient as the rest of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.84,0:17:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I was right to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd soon start carelessly\Ndriving everything down into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,From the street lamps, to the roadsides,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,heck, even a couple of parked\Ncars, right down to their tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.30,0:17:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Silly me, I'm wasting my\Ntime lecturing the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gone and done it now,\Nyou rotten son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.36,0:17:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm perfectly fine, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still hear yeah,\Nyeah that horrible tire
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,pump came from over\Nthere which can only mean
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.06,0:17:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.04,0:17:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the shit did that bastard do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.36,0:18:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I mistake him for a freaking car?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.64,0:18:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eardrums have just been ruptured.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you call your\Nground melting stand again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanctuary, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.26,0:18:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Without your keen sense of hearing serving\Nas its sonar, it seems rather impotent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You were trying to burst my\Neardrums this entire time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You think my sanctuary is useless\Nwithout my super-powered sonar skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's stupid and not\Ntrue at all! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, I won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.59,0:18:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,now that you know about the\Nman we're supposed to meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.48,0:18:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't exactly let you run off either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll incapacitate\Nyou posthaste. You dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you said something about\Nincapacitating me just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.11,0:18:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not stupid, I can tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Zip it, Walnut Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can barely understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.16,0:19:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, try and lay even a finger on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn this meat\Nshield into a pile of mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.44,0:19:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll fling his bits\Nat you and run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you wouldn't want to have bloody\Nkitty chunks on your hands, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.00,0:19:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.91,0:19:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Change of plans!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.83,0:19:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of getting rid of the boss myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.06,0:19:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll just report to him\Neverything that happened today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,so he'll call me a good boy and\Ngive me a nice juicy reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, that's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm better off just having the\NFamily take care of me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey brat, get me a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.90,0:19:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, raise those arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Up, hail me a cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I said work those damn noodle arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you deaf or something, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid kid, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.88,0:19:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A taxi! Hail me! A cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one step closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:19:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I swear I'm gonna do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll melt this kid down to mud!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What, are you playing dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can hear me, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.78,0:20:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now, you can drop\Nthe big tough guy routine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.72,0:20:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know your stance range\Nis a measly two meters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You think just because my leg's broken\Nthat I can't put more distance between us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare try me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill this sweet child!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you want to tickle me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.28,0:20:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of range, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.41,0:20:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.33,0:20:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All you did was graze me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.12,0:20:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you just do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your zipper!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it doing to my...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did it get...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I needed confirmation, but\NI guess it's nice to know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no way Bucciarati\Nwould have let any
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,sort of harm befall an\Ninnocent kid like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.64,0:20:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:20:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta get this thing off of me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.54,0:21:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Cioccolata!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cioccolata!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.34,0:21:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I managed to locate and catch up to\NSeko by tracing his cell phone signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.62,0:21:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like things are\Nstraying from the boss's plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that Seko had\Nalready been beaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.16,0:21:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That likely means Chocolata's out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.96,0:21:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, why is Bucciarati\Nout here all by himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.90,0:21:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't he usually with Giorno,\NGiovanna, and Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.18,0:21:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My strength, it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lift my miseria.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.80,0:21:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my vision's blurring.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I finally out of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.56,0:21:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew this moment would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.70,0:21:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.58,0:22:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fiction. What is the truth?\NThey have the mission. They are the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.14,0:22:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Passion, but they dare to tell us\Nwhat's bad and what's good. Stand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.68,0:22:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,up Join us Come on Just see this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the power. Cause they're
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.66,0:22:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the future Cause we are the\Nfighters Just fighting for the right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.92,0:22:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous, I'm so nervous,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.72,0:23:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.22,0:24:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.13,0:24:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,you.
